-# Mockup: #/s/badges, js-expanded/30-sp.js:25-28.
-#
-# Earned badges lie front up; the rest are turned over, and their back carries
-# the house mark and "Jak zdobyć" — the art is the reward, so it stays hidden
-# until the badge is yours. An earned card can be turned over to re-read how it
-# was won (badge_flip_controller); an unearned one cannot be turned at all.
%section.gh-panel.gh-phead
  .gh-phead-t
    %h1.gh-h1 Odznaki
    %p.gh-lead
      = "Masz #{shelf.earned_count} z #{shelf.size}."
      Odznaki przyznaje prowadzący. Na odwrocie każdej niezdobytej znajdziesz,
      jak ją zdobyć.

- if shelf.any?
  .gh-cards.gh-cards--b
    - shelf.slots.each do |slot|
      = render 'flip_card', badge: slot.badge,
        earned: slot.earned?,
        interactive: slot.earned?,
        withdrawn: slot.withdrawn?
- else
  %section.gh-panel.gh-gm
    %h2.gh-h2 W tej grupie nie ma jeszcze odznak
    %p.gh-lead
      Prowadzący ich nie dodał. Kiedy się pojawią, zobaczysz tu, co trzeba
      zrobić, żeby je zdobyć.
